Changes: retain only the RGB slots used by this mockup, rename the exported
constants for their Theme slots, and omit terminal color quantization.
The base background uses OpenAgents' shared Coder near-black value.
The screen layout, editor, and SVG exporter are implemented in OpenAgents.

The mock Edit calls reuse the Grok diff renderer in coder-terminal and the
Grok Night syntax highlighter in code-highlight. Their source attribution
and licenses are retained in code-highlight/NOTICE.

Transcript messages reuse the Grok Markdown layout and transcript styles in
coder-terminal, including fenced-code highlighting from code-highlight. Their
source attribution and licenses are retained in code-highlight/NOTICE.
